cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "tflspec" in publications use:'
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: 'tflspec: Excel Specifications for Clinical Tables, Listings and Figures'
abstract: 'Reads study specifications written in Excel and produces what a clinical
  TFL report is made of: analysis results data (ARD) normalized and laid out through
  a declarative plan, rendered as tables by the rtfreporter package, plus skeleton
  ggplot2 code generated from a plot specification for figures.'
authors:
- family-names: Masui
  given-names: Yoichi
  email: ichi.r.pro@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/ichirio/tflspec
url: https://ichirio.github.io/tflspec/
keywords:
- clinical trials
- TFL
- Excel
- analysis results data
- R package

